  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention of Re-introduction of Malaria in Sri Lanka - Sri Lanka (01-Jan-2019-31-Dec-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka, Malaria, Ministry of Health and Mass Media of the Democratic Socialist  Republic of Sri Lanka (MOH)This program has the following goals: A malaria - free Sri Lanka. The objectives of this program are: To prevent re-introduction and re-establishment of malaria in Sri Lanka.  To maintain zero mortality due to malaria in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </description>
